{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項新研究發現，幼年黑猩猩的叫聲可能會隨着成長而逐漸呈現出不同羣體的特徵，類似人類在成長過程中形成的地區口音。這一發現表明，黑猩猩的發聲並非完全由基因決定，社會互動和所處環境也可能在其溝通方式的塑造中發揮重要作用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587720.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T20:00:27.170145+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:40:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_hash":"089c51f181c9148b77a10a53750daed075353e030d58938e0b101a50c09dd7fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}